  //   steelseries-arctis-nova-5: interface (HID interface number) and usage (vendor usage of the status collection).
  //   rapoo-hid: interface (HID interface number) and usage (vendor usage of the collection that pushes report 0xBB).
  //   redragon-hid: interface (HID interface number) and usage (vendor usage of the collection that pushes report 0x13).
